{
  "_why": "Shared scenarios for the watchdog's rules. The tests run them against src/watchdog.mjs (Node, on agent hosts) and device/sitter.py (Python, on the KVM), so every watcher decides alike. Each step: minutes since start, what the watcher sees, then the state and the actions (kinds) it must choose. The runner performs every action except wait, appending {at, kind, state} to the ledger.",
